1
00:00:00,603 --> 00:00:03,333
(Leonard:)I think there's been
a misunderstanding.

2
00:00:03,339 --> 00:00:05,269
See, Penny is my fiancée.

3
00:00:05,274 --> 00:00:07,504
(Man:)Really?

4
00:00:08,611 --> 00:00:11,411
(Man:)I've never seen her wear
an engagement ring.

5
00:00:12,581 --> 00:00:14,151
WOLOWITZ AND KOOTHRAPPALI:
Really?

6
00:00:18,287 --> 00:00:20,287
(Man:)So, am I to presume

7
00:00:20,289 --> 00:00:23,329
(Man:)that her flirtation was
just a sales technique?

8
00:00:23,326 --> 00:00:25,126
(Leonard:)I think so.

9
00:00:25,127 --> 00:00:27,997
(Man:)When will I learn?

10
00:00:27,997 --> 00:00:32,197
(Man:)It's just like the cute girl
at the pet store all over again.

11
00:00:32,201 --> 00:00:34,031
(Leonard:)Excuse me?

12
00:00:34,036 --> 00:00:38,206
(Man:)Oh, uh, she touched my arm
for five Mississippis,

13
00:00:38,207 --> 00:00:41,037
(Man:)and I bought
a $2,000 iguana habitat.

14
00:00:43,346 --> 00:00:47,186
(Man:)Which she was always too busy
to come over and see.

15
00:00:48,451 --> 00:00:51,021
(Man:)You give these to Penny.

16
00:00:51,020 --> 00:00:53,090
You're, you're a lucky man.

17
00:00:54,557 --> 00:00:56,127
(Man with Flowers:)Thank you.

18
00:00:56,125 --> 00:00:57,155
(Leonard:)Sorry.

19
00:00:57,159 --> 00:00:58,859
(Man:)Oh, uh...

20
00:00:58,861 --> 00:01:00,831
(Man:)You probably don't want her
to see this.

